      ***************************************************************
      * C2100-PRICE-VARIANCE:                                       *
      *     1. CALCULATE PRICE VARIANCE AGAINST PREVIOUS PRICE      *
      *        FOR REGULAR RUN AND AGAINST CURRENT PRICE FOR        *
      *        REPLACEMENT RUN.                                     *
      *     2. TOTAL PARTS PRICE VARIANCE (FOR AVERAGE CALCULATION) *
      *     3. WRITE REPORT ROW FOR PARTS W/ VARIANCE GT 25% AND    *
      *        THAT HAVE CEG LINES TO THE ORACLE REPORT TABLE.      *
      *     4. TALLY PCT AND COUNT INTO OVERALL TOTALS FOR CNTL RPT.*
      ***************************************************************
       C2100-PRICE-VARIANCE.
           MOVE "C2100-PRICE-VARIANCE.    " TO WS-PARAGRAPH.

      * BYPASS VARIANCE CALC & RPTING, IF PREVIOUS PRICE IS ZERO
           IF WS-PREV-PRICE-AMT EQUAL ZERO
              GO TO C2100-EXIT.

           SUBTRACT WS-PREV-PRICE-AMT FROM WS-TR-PRICE
                   GIVING WS-CALC-VAR-AMT.
           COMPUTE WS-CALC-VAR-PCT ROUNDED =
                   (WS-CALC-VAR-AMT / WS-PREV-PRICE-AMT) * 100.

           IF WS-CALC-VAR-PCT < ZERO
             MULTIPLY WS-CALC-VAR-PCT BY -1 GIVING WS-COMP-VAR-PCT
           ELSE
             MOVE WS-CALC-VAR-PCT TO WS-COMP-VAR-PCT.

           IF WS-COMP-VAR-PCT > TWENTY-FIVE-PCT
             PERFORM C2600-ADDTO-PRUPVAR-CTRS THRU C2600-EXIT
             IF WS-CEGLN-COUNT > ZERO
             OR WS-WIPLN-COUNT > ZERO
                PERFORM G1000-PRICE-VAR-REPORT THRU G1000-EXIT.

      * DON'T INCL. PART WHICH IS NEWLY ZERO-PRICED INTO OVERALL FIGURES
           IF WS-TR-PRICE EQUAL ZERO
             PERFORM C2700-ADDTO-ZPNEW-CTRS THRU C2700-EXIT
             GO TO C2100-EXIT.

      * DON'T INCL. PART WITH PERCENT > 100 INTO OVERALL FIGURES
           IF WS-COMP-VAR-PCT > 100
             GO TO C2100-EXIT.

      * ADD TO INCREASE AND OVERALL VARIANCE FIGURES
           IF WS-TR-PRICE < WS-PREV-PRICE-AMT
                 GO TO C2100-CONT.

           IF WS-CEGLN-COUNT > ZERO
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOT-CEG-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOT-CEG-PCT
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOTI-CEG-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOTI-CEG-PCT.

           IF WS-WIPLN-COUNT > ZERO
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOT-WIP-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOT-WIP-PCT
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOTI-WIP-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOTI-WIP-PCT.

           ADD 1               TO RS-TOT-ALL-PCTR.
           ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOT-ALL-PCT.
           ADD 1               TO RS-TOTI-ALL-PCTR.
           ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOTI-ALL-PCT.

           GO TO C2100-EXIT.

       C2100-CONT.
           MOVE "C2100-CONT.              " TO WS-PARAGRAPH.

      * ADD TO DECREASE AND OVERALL VARIANCE FIGURES
           IF WS-CEGLN-COUNT > ZERO
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOT-CEG-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOT-CEG-PCT
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOTD-CEG-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOTD-CEG-PCT.

           IF WS-WIPLN-COUNT > ZERO
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOT-WIP-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOT-WIP-PCT
             ADD 1               TO RS-TOTD-WIP-PCTR
             ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOTD-WIP-PCT.

           ADD 1               TO RS-TOT-ALL-PCTR.
           ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOT-ALL-PCT.
           ADD 1               TO RS-TOTD-ALL-PCTR.
           ADD WS-COMP-VAR-PCT TO RS-TOTD-ALL-PCT.

       C2100-EXIT. EXIT.

