           IF RS-TOT-WIP-PCTR > 0
             DIVIDE RS-TOT-WIP-PCT BY RS-TOT-WIP-PCTR
                   GIVING RPT04-WIP-AVG-PCT
           ELSE
             MOVE ZEROES TO RPT04-WIP-AVG-PCT.
           IF RS-TOTI-WIP-PCTR > 0
             DIVIDE RS-TOTI-WIP-PCT BY RS-TOTI-WIP-PCTR
                   GIVING RPT04-WIP-AVG-PCTI
           ELSE
             MOVE ZEROES TO RPT04-WIP-AVG-PCTI.
           IF RS-TOTD-WIP-PCTR > 0
             DIVIDE RS-TOTD-WIP-PCT BY RS-TOTD-WIP-PCTR
                   GIVING RPT04-WIP-AVG-PCTD
           ELSE
             MOVE ZEROES TO RPT04-WIP-AVG-PCTD.

           MOVE DETAIL-04E          TO REPORT-DATA.

           PERFORM R9100-INSERT-REPORT THRU R9100-EXIT.
           MOVE "F"                 TO SRT4-REC-TYPE.
           MOVE "1"                 TO SRT4-REC-TYPE-CTR.
           IF RS-TOT-ALL-PCTR > 0
             DIVIDE RS-TOT-ALL-PCT BY RS-TOT-ALL-PCTR
                   GIVING RPT04-ALL-AVG-PCT
           ELSE
             MOVE ZEROES TO RPT04-ALL-AVG-PCT.
           IF RS-TOTI-ALL-PCTR > 0
