      ***************************************************************
      * Y1000-SQL-ERROR:                                            *
      *     1. PREPARE TO ABORT PROGRAM DUE TO SQL ERROR            *
      *     2. ROLLBACK ORACLE UPDATES SINCE LAST COMMIT PERFORMED  *
      ***************************************************************
       Y1000-SQL-ERROR.

           DISPLAY WS-PARAGRAPH.
           DISPLAY 'SQLCODE    : ',SQLCODE.

           IF SQLCODE < 0
               COMPUTE WS-ABEND-CODE = SQLCODE * -1
           ELSE
               MOVE SQLCODE TO WS-ABEND-CODE.

