      ***************************************************************
       Y1500-SQL-PROCEDURE-ERROR.

           IF SQLCODE < 0
               COMPUTE WS-ABEND-CODE = SQLCODE * -1
           ELSE
               MOVE SQLCODE TO WS-ABEND-CODE.

