           DISPLAY "        " WS-ERROR-TEXT.

           EXEC SQL
               ROLLBACK
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM Y2000-ABEND-RTN THRU Y2000-EXIT.

       Y1500-EXIT. EXIT.

